This is the ying-companion pnpm + Turborepo monorepo.

- Root commands: see docs/ai/core/project-context.md
- apps/web: read apps/web/AGENTS.md when working in the web app
- apps/api: read apps/api/AGENTS.md when working in the API

Use Turbo filters for package-scoped tasks: `pnpm turbo run <task> --filter @ying-companion/<web|api>`
